{"title":"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The coordinates of three of the vertices of a rectangle are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bb913ad463dcc2916d4135977f0d06f20ad93cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71ddcbfaee6e9e4fa89d6a8c71928633cd556925.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f07fa47219e5e6360e14fea5ac00ee7b437bfc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. What are the coordinates of the fourth vertex of the rectangle?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that a rectangle with fourth vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/e/e5e0dcfb692a93aa9b3969e538b180c59eea8514.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(1,4)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"54\" height=\"32\" /> would have sides defined by the lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45bc0006df273cb384b6c864236b3c1bf292e898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7f6230166a491e7a471a03829c792496576480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, which works.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC\">2025 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.